sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client on device D
    participant RP as Public RP
    participant A as Private Authority
    participant TS as tailscaled

    C->>RP: Start session or submit protected transaction
    Note over RP: Check Origin and request limits<br/>For tx, compute Q from the request
    RP->>A: POST /v1/transaction: protocol, draft, audience, profile, assurance=device, Q for tx
    Note over A: Authenticate RP; negotiate draft and assurance<br/>Bind registered origin; create pending cid, C, S
    A-->>RP: protocol, draft, rp_id, cid, C, Authority URL, relative expiry
    Note over RP: Store state-cookie hash and deadline<br/>For tx, store the original request
    RP-->>C: protocol, draft, cid, C, Authority URL; set __Host- state cookie

    Note over C: Generate N; compute H1<br/>For tx, compute Q from the exact sent request
    C->>A: POST /attestation: cid, N, H1; configured Origin
    Note over A: Check Host and Origin before reading state<br/>Check pending deadline, bound origin, and H1
    A->>TS: status / whois for socket peer address
    TS-->>A: Authenticated node identity and tags
    Note over A: Reject shared or unknown peers<br/>Check identity agreement and RP device policy<br/>pending → base_attested → redeemable<br/>Reserve one-use delivery and start 10 s redemption window
    A-->>C: H2: authenticated encryption of IP and S
    Note over C: Authenticate and decrypt H2<br/>Compute redemption proof R

    C->>RP: POST /bytebind/proof: cid, R; state cookie and Origin
    Note over RP: Check Origin and state cookie<br/>Atomically claim ceremony; check deadline
    RP->>A: POST /v1/redemption: cid, R, audience
    Note over A: Authenticate RP; check scope, deadline, and R<br/>Recheck current device policy; redeem once
    A-->>RP: Active grant, audience, claims, device assurance, relative expiry
    Note over RP: Check active grant, audience, draft and assurance

    alt Session profile
        RP-->>C: Set lease cookie; return session result
        C->>RP: Protected API request with lease cookie
        Note over RP: Check lease expiry and every route requirement
        RP-->>C: Handler result or access denied
    else Transaction-bound profile
        Note over RP: Replay stored request with grant<br/>Check operation and every route requirement<br/>Run handler at most once if authorized
        RP-->>C: Operation result or access denied
    end
